# Regression: everything said before a program hangs must already be on the
# console. otter-net buffered its output, so a never-ending program (stopped
# by the harness's timeout, or by Ctrl+C) showed nothing (fuzz, 2026-10-16).
say "first line"
say "second line"
step is 2
while step is at least 2
    total is step
.
